    {
      "id": "a3t4hujy",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "16th, 17th and the 18th of november have brought thunderstorms into Central Europe, with the 18th being the most active."
    },
    {
      "id": "gl2rbo4h",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "CESTOF has issued a forecast for the 18th of november, mentioning strong non-convective wind gusts and lightning. the forecast was successful, with both the strong non-convective wind gusts and lightning in the highlighted areas. The archived forecast with the discussion can be found here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.cestof.com/archive?date=2026-11-18&amp;hazard=general&amp;view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.cestof.com/archive?date=2026-11-18&amp;hazard=general&amp;view=all</a>",
      "text": "",
      "src": "",
      "items": [],
      "ordered": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b0rrwm0z",
      "type": "image",
      "html": "",
