      "src": "img/articles/late-autumn-thunderstorms-in-central-europe/b0rrwm0z.png",
      "items": [],
      "ordered": false,
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "Forecast for 18/11/2026",
      "credit": "CESTOF"
    },
    {
      "id": "t3eob9eq",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Lightning in late autumn isnt really a rare occasion, but lightning of this scale and 3 days in a row is. Slovakia, Germany and Hungary were hit the most. In the maps bellow you can see the days and where lightning occured. Maps are taken from:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://blesky.bourky.cz/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://blesky.bourky.cz/</a>",
      "text": "",
      "src": "",
